fields.value:
{{Stealnotes
| name = Puck Phase Shift
| desc = Does not interrupt {{M|channeling}} upon losing the ability.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** {{M|Disjoints}} incoming {{M|projectiles}} upon cast.
** {{Symbol|Channeling}}
*** Grants Puck the following propertiles while [[channeling]]:
**** {{M|Hidden}}
**** {{M|Invulnerable}}
**** Does not grant {{M|phase movement}}.
*** The following sources interrupts Phase Shift's channeling despite not normally doing so:
**** {{A|Shadow Blade|Shadow Walk}}-based items.
**** {{A|Shiva's Guard|Arctic Blast}}

* {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|puck_phase_shift}}
** The buff lingers for one {{M|server tick}} upon the ability ending in any way, which allows using items while still being {{M|hidden|x}} and {{M|invulnerable|x}}.
<hr>
* {{cf|shdnotes}} Adds two passive components to Phase Shift upon cast.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|21px|1]]
*** {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Instant}}
**** [[Instant attack]]s all {{M|vision|text=visible}} and attackable enemy units within the radius upon cast.
***** Procs all {{M|attack modifiers}} and {{M|on-cast effects}} as per normal.
***** Does not have {{M|True Strike}}.
***** Not affected by {{M|disarm}} sources.
***** Does not attack the following units:
****** {{M|Attached-type units}}.
****** {{M|Ward-type units}}.
****** {{U|Undying Zombie|text=Undying Zombies}}.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|21px|2]] {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Conditional}}
*** Applies a flat {{M|magical}} {{M|bonus attack damage}} per successful attack.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Phase Shift icon0}}
| desc = CHANNELED - Puck briefly shifts into another dimension where it is immune from harm.
}}
* {{cf|shdnotes}} For {{M|melee}} units, if the enemy target is {{G|melee miss range}} range farther than the attacker's range, the attack will {{M|miss}} regardless.

